$MDESC::Type = "Capture the Flag";
$MDESC::Text = "<s3><f1>Mission Type: <f0> Capture The Flag" @
	"\n<f1>Planet: <f0> Dagobah" @
	"\n<f1>Weather: <f0> Hazy" @
	"\n<f1>Time of Day: <f0> Midday" @
	"\n<f1># of Teams: <f0> 2" @
	"\n\n<f1>Briefing: <f0> On the swamp planet of Dagobah, the Rebel Alliance has set up a small recon base hoping to take back the galaxy. While the Empire has landed near them to eradicate their existence. Fight carefully, the Empire has an advantage but the Rebels have a surprise. Join a team and fight for who you want.  By the way doesn't Yoda live there? Its my first map so have fun!             -XGN Darth Maul";
